n- [OWASP Cryptographic Storage Cheat Sheet](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Cryptographic_Storage_Cheat_Sheet.html)\n- [CWE-338: Use of Cryptographically Weak Pseudo-Random Number Generator (PRNG)](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/338.html)"
